    "detailed_description": "<br><br>You are a fish. You play volleyball. Taxes, homework, the corporate grind: all curios beyond your wildest imagination.<br><br>Up to 10 aquatic friends can flop around the volleyball court in this local multiplayer physics-driven arcade sports throwback.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1982410/extras/60345abbcb679c13c654e9aa4744aebc.poster.avif?t=1676608760\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1982410/extras/60345abbcb679c13c654e9aa4744aebc.webm?t=1676608760\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1982410/extras/60345abbcb679c13c654e9aa4744aebc.mp4?t=1676608760\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Physics-driven local multiplayer volleyball</h2><br>Ah, the multiplayer of yore. Remember sitting on the couch with friends laughing at a silly game for hours on end?<br><br>Face off one-on-one to prove your <strong>Fish Volleyball</strong> superiority or embrace the chaos in five-on-five pandemonium.<br><br>Precise timing, positioning, and control of your fish is paramount to victory. Think QWOP meets Slime Volleyball.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1982410/extras/2319d900df42c867b4db9044ab811a8f.poster.avif?t=1676608760\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1982410/extras/2319d900df42c867b4db9044ab811a8f.webm?t=1676608760\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1982410/extras/2319d900df42c867b4db9044ab811a8f.mp4?t=1676608760\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Easy to learn, hard to master</h2><br>It's only one button and a joystick. How hard could it be?<br><br>Master the profoundly-complex mechanics of <strong>Fish Volleyball</strong> to perform high-flying spikes, blocks, rallies, sets, serves, pancakes (it's a volleyball term; look it up), spins, and aces. Simple in concept, difficult in execution.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1982410/extras/2fe7c71d734bee09cb6e292eed705e83.poster.avif?t=1676608760\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1982410/extras/2fe7c71d734bee09cb6e292eed705e83.webm?t=1676608760\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1982410/extras/2fe7c71d734bee09cb6e292eed705e83.mp4?t=1676608760\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Deeply modifiable</h2><br>With a multitude of game modifiers, create any of the millions of possible custom matches. You wanna play volleyball with a massive football in low gravity while players hop the net to tackle one another? Go for it.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1982410/extras/67b7e0ef07c923fc566a8413eda2bfbd.poster.avif?t=1676608760\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1982410/extras/67b7e0ef07c923fc566a8413eda2bfbd.webm?t=1676608760\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1982410/extras/67b7e0ef07c923fc566a8413eda2bfbd.mp4?t=1676608760\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Rich Lore</h2><br>Fish play volleyball.",
